{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Revenu disponible brut ajusté des ménages par personne","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-02-27T23:00:00+0100","value":{},"id":["freq","unit","geo","time"],"size":[1,1,0,25],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Fréquence (relative au temps)","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Annuel"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unité de mesure","category":{"index":{"CVA":0},"label":{"CVA":"Coefficient de variation de la valeur absolue"}}},"geo":{"label":"Entité géopolitique (déclarante)","category":{"index":{},"label":{}}},"time":{"label":"Temps","category":{"index":{"2000":0,"2001":1,"2002":2,"2003":3,"2004":4,"2005":5,"2006":6,"2007":7,"2008":8,"2009":9,"2010":10,"2011":11,"2012":12,"2013":13,"2014":14,"2015":15,"2016":16,"2017":17,"2018":18,"2019":19,"2020":20,"2021":21,"2022":22,"2023":23,"2024":24},"label":{"2000":"2000","2001":"2001","2002":"2002","2003":"2003","2004":"2004","2005":"2005","2006":"2006","2007":"2007","2008":"2008","2009":"2009","2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"FR","description":"<p>Le revenu disponible brut ajusté des ménages reflète le pouvoir d'achat des ménages, après impôts et cotisations sociales, y compris les prestations sociales en nature. Les valeurs du revenu national sont converties en standards de pouvoir d'achat (SPA) pour tenir compte des différences de niveau de prix entre les pays et permettre une comparaison significative. L'indicateur de disparités pour l'UE est calculé comme le coefficient de variation des données de revenu nationales en SPA par habitant. Il s'agit d'une mesure des différences de revenu des ménages au sein de l'UE et de la zone euro.</p>","id":"SDG_10_20","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"SDG_10_20","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"55.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2025-04-29T15:59:33+0200"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/SDG_10_20\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/SDG_10_20</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-19</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf","text":"Avis important"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE","title":"DATASET"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_DATA","date":"2026-02-27T23:00:00+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_GLOBAL","date":"2026-05-28T23:00:00+0200"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_PLANNED","date":"2026-05-28T23:00:00+0200"},{"type":"ESMS_HTML","title":"Explanatory texts (metadata)","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.htm"},{"type":"ESMS_SDMX","title":"Explanatory texts (metadata)","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.sdmx.zip"},{"type":"OBS_COUNT","title":"50"},{"type":"OBS_PERIOD_OVERALL_LATEST","title":"2024"},{"type":"OBS_PERIOD_OVERALL_OLDEST","title":"2000"},{"type":"SOURCE_I